flowchart TB
  H5[客户订货 H5]
  ADMIN[管理后台]
  SCREEN[排行 / 战报 / 抽奖大屏]
  NGINX[Nginx / HTTPS]
  API[Spring Boot 模块化单体]
  MYSQL[(MySQL 业务主数据)]
  REDIS[(Redis 缓存 / 限流 / 幂等 / 锁)]
  OBJECT[(MinIO / S3 对象存储)]

  H5 -->|REST| NGINX
  ADMIN -->|REST| NGINX
  SCREEN -->|REST + SSE| NGINX
  NGINX --> API
  API --> MYSQL
  API --> REDIS
  API --> OBJECT

